# One Groq API key per line. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Each key takes every Nth program, writes data/runs/llm_shardN.csv, and those
# are folded back into llm.csv. Order decides the split, so keep it stable:
# reordering makes every worker resume on a slice it has not started.
#
# Using keys from separate accounts to exceed a per-account limit is against
# Groq's acceptable use policy, which names it directly.
#
# gsk_first_key_here
# gsk_second_key_here
